    takeHome: "Read Psalm 51 and Romans 3:9-26. Write a short paragraph describing what sin is in your own words and why admitting it is the first step toward the gospel. Memorise Romans 3:23.",
    prayer: "Worship God for his holiness. Ask him to show us our sin honestly. Thank him that he forgives and that we do not need to hide.",
